# Where the app's data comes from (src/api/source.ts). Copy this file to .env.local and change it
# there, then restart Metro with: npx expo start --clear
#   demo                        the mock API inside the app: works on any phone, no server needed
#   http://localhost:4000       your own server, for the web preview and the iOS Simulator
#   http://10.0.2.2:4000        the same server, from the Android emulator
#   http://192.168.1.42:4000    the same server, from Expo Go on a phone (your computer's address)
# Never put a secret in an EXPO_PUBLIC_ variable: it is copied into the app for anyone to read.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=demo
